# Integration tests — added per phase as features are implemented.
# See .planning/TESTING_CONTEXT.md for the testing standard.
#
# Integration tests use REAL infrastructure:
#   - Real PostgreSQL (no SQLite, no mocked Drizzle)
#   - Real Redis
#   - Real PgBoss
#   - Real Fastify via buildApp() + app.inject()
#
# Isolation strategy: randomized runId per test run — scoped queries only.
# Never use unscoped COUNT(*) or global truncation.
